# [resolution]` action, the `candidates(hole)` action with the five-
# ganglion body, the `compose(rule, rule) -> rule` associative
# composition. The boot/ directory was killed in spring-clean per
# Taut scout `27c8592`; the tournament content was orphaned.
#
# Per the chain's three-tier migration mapping (per spec §4.7 +
# `shards/autopoietic.mirror`'s tick_action carrier):
