#                                                 action
#   `rule = greedy | beam | elite | halving |     THIS shard's `rule`
#    tabu | anneal | ucb`                         sum-type carrier
#                                                 (preserved verbatim)
#   `compose(rule, rule) -> rule`                 THIS shard's
