#
# The migration is now COMPLETE for the tournament's substrate-decl
# discipline. The 15+ specs that reference the boot/std/fate/tournament.
# mirror content (kintsugi-tournament.md, substrate-native-fate-
# tournament.md, kintsugi-wiring.md, code-metalogue-surface.md,
